        <description>Extract the Income Tax or Tax Expense charged for the financial year.

This field may appear under any of these labels:
- Tax Expense, Income Tax, Tax Provision
- Tax Payable, Net Tax Payable
- Current Tax, Deferred Tax
- Tax There on (in ITR computation sheets)
- Provision for Tax

Rules:
- For proprietorships and partnerships: tax is personal, may NOT appear in P&amp;L — return NOT_FOUND in that case
- For companies: this appears as "Tax Expense" or "Provision for Tax" in P&amp;L
- Do NOT include GST, TDS deducted, or advance tax paid as "tax expense"
- Return plain number only. If not found, return: NA</description>
